FA --> FAFR002 : View client intervention alerts
FA --> FAFR003 : View predictive analytics about clients' situations
FA --> AIFR013: Analyze client data for predictions (for generating recommendations)

SA --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters

SFR008 <|-- AIFR006: Generate anomaly transaction alerts 
AIFR002 <|-- SFR004: Provide personalized recommendations
